### Playable Controls & Logic Summary
- **States in `CHART_SPEC`**: `incoming` (`100% Incoming`), `qualified` (`70% Qualified`), `dropoff` (`30% Drop-off`), `won` (`55% Won`), and `lost` (`15% Lost`), with proportional ribbon widths (`140px`, `60px`, `110px`, `30px`) matching the `70% / 30%` and `55% / 15%` splits.
- **Playable controls**: Use **Play**, **Step**, **Reset**, the **Events** buttons (`Qualify (70%)`, `Drop-off (30%)`, `Win (55%)`, `Lose (15%)`, `Restart`), or click/Enter on any stage bar in the SVG to isolate its Sankey flow path and update the `aria-live="polite"` status bar.
- **"Show the logic"**: Opens the synchronized **Rules** (`R1`–`R7`) and **Logic Flowchart** drawer, highlighting the active stage and last-fired transition rule in real time.
